I wasn't able to replicate the issue but I only have access to a Mac and the issue appears Windows specific. The cause isn't obvious (to me) based just on the commits cherry-picked into 1.16.2 from the previous 1.16.1 either.

Since I can't replicate it locally, I won't be able to dig into it myself. I'll continue following the thread so I can spin a 1.16.3 if needed once we know of a fix.

@participant9, @participant33, @participant34, or @participant17 do you know who could take this investigation on?

